<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications fell 28.8 percent in the week ended April 4, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages dropped 39.7 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages decreased 25.4 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index fell 45.7 percent to 292.3 from 538.4 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 32.4 percent to 174.0 in the latest survey from 257.3 in the previous week.  </p>
